      "text": "UCR provides substantial mathematics, computing, statistical learning and applied econometrics, with a second consumer/business direction. It does not reproduce VU’s Econometrics I–III, mathematical learning guarantees, dedicated multivariate-statistics and fairness/privacy methods, integrated practicals or compulsory12EC thesis. Accounting concerns financial statements; Linear Systems concerns signals. Neither supplies the missing finance or econometric time-series sequence. No course equivalence or automatic master’s admission is established."
