    "comparisonExplanation": "Two qualified UCR approaches offer substantial quantitative and computational study: econometrics with economic analysis, and consumer/marketing data analysis. Their courses do not reproduce the full advanced econometric, mathematical-statistics or theoretical machine-learning sequence, integrated EDS practicals and compulsory thesis. Accounting and signals analysis remain specific complements. Neither composition establishes degree equivalence or automatic postgraduate eligibility.",
